mpaign=infinite-ai-slop-is-here\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Hy4 Preview</a> - Tencent’s new 770-billion-parameter flagship model with 49 billion active parameters and a 1-million-token context window</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=63GVebZvqok&amp;utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=infinite-ai-slop-is-here\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Claude Cowork</a> - the desktop app now includes a built-in browser that lets Claude navigate websites, fill out forms, and pull data from portals</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.skydive.com/?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=infinite-ai-slop-is-here\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Skydive</a> - creates full-fledged AI coworkers that handle real tasks inside your existing apps without complicated setup</p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"border-bottom-left-radius:0px;padding:7.0px 2.0px 7.0px 2.0px;margin:15.0px 2.0px 0.0px 2.0px;border-top-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-color:#222222;border-top-right-radius:15px;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:4px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:4px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:700;font-size:27px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\">WHAT I'M CONSUMING</h1>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:15px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#222222;border-left-width:1px;border-right-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-top-width:0px;margin:0.0px 2.0px 15.0px 2.0px;padding:2.0px 2.0px 2.0px 2.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:37px;padding-right:27px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <ul style=\"color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Roboto',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;list-style-type:disc;margin:0px 0px 0px 25px;padding:0;\">\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">The rise and fall of <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.dwarkesh.com/p/openai-huggingface?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=infinite-ai-slop-is-here\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Agent Civilizations</a></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Patterns in&nbsp;<a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/research/enabling-independent-research?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=infinite-ai-slop-is-here\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">how people use Claude</a>&nbsp;from 250k anonymised chats</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://x.com/brian_armstrong/status/2092351333567430683?s=20&amp;utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=infinite-ai-slop-is-here\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">One solution</a> is to train the AI to write like you</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">The dream of Quantum Computing Is <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/features/2026-08-26/quantum-computers-promise-breakthroughs-but-risk-a-cybersecurity-crisis?accessToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzb3VyY2UiOiJTdWJzY3JpYmVyR2lmdGVkQXJ0aWNsZSIsImlhdCI6MTc4ODE0ODczNSwiZXhwIjoxNzg4NzUzNTM1LCJhcnRpY2xlSWQiOiJUS0REMDlLSUpIOEwwMCIsImJjb25uZWN0SWQiOiJCMzZENUE5QzIxMDQ0NjU4OTFBMTc1MTVDRDNBQkZFNiJ9.7DCwJE-axlyNWlkdVfuGCeXEjk8ispLXc6kcRF-0HJ8&amp;utm_source=tldrnewsletter\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">both dead and alive</a></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.skild.ai/blogs/s1?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=infinite-ai-slop-is-here\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Teach a robot new tasks</a>&nbsp;from just one video</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Harvard and MIT build AI agents that power <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/papers/2608.04205?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=infinite-ai-slop-is-here\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">8.3 billion simulated user personas</a></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">A16Z&nbsp;<a class=\"link\" href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/28/a16z-creates-a-1-1b-machine-age-fund-to-accelerate-the-physical-buildout-of-ai/?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=infinite-ai-slop-is-here\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">raises $1.1 billion Machine Age AI</a>&nbsp;infrastructure fund</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">OpenAI will reportedly&nbsp;<a class=\"link\" href=\"https://x.com/alexeheath/status/2093369629116973461?s=20&amp;utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=infinite-ai-slop-is-here\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">eventually build a humanoid robot</a></p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"border-bottom-left-radius:0px;padding:7.0px 2.0px 7.0px 2.0px;margin:15.0px 2.0px 0.0px 2.0px;border-top-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-color:#222222;border-top-right-radius:15px;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:4px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:4px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:700;font-size:27px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\">THE VALLEY GEMS</h1>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"backgroun